      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/YShared.Console.YCommandAttribute.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\"><b>Define a new command.</b></p>\n<ul><li>\n        Use <code>YCInt(min, max)</code> for integer arguments. (min / max optional)\n    </li><li>\n        Use <code>YCFloat(min, max)</code> for float arguments. (min / max optional)\n    </li><li>\n        Use <code>YCEnum(typeof(Enum))</code> for enum arguments.\n    </li><li>\n        Use <code>YCBool</code> for boolean arguments.\n    </li><li>\n        Use <code>YCString</code> for string arguments.\n    </li><li>\n        Use <code>YCCmdArg</code> to get registered commands as an input. (Use Command[])\n    </li></ul>\n"
